Timothy Murphy writes:

> Is it any more (or less) commercial than PostScript?

In principle one may "print" a DVI without using Tom Rokicki's
excellent dvi driver "dvips" for PostScript printers or its
children.

I wonder how many of us using "dvips" actually have printers that
speak PostScript natively?

